<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Basic SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Welcome to the presentation</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Today we will discuss subtitle formats</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>SAMI was developed by Microsoft</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>It uses HTML-like syntax with SYNC tags</P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Each SYNC block has a start time in milliseconds</P>

<SYNC Start=15000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Thank you for watching!</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
